  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/09/IMG_3072.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El caf&eacute;-rock La Oveja Negra, en la calle Mallorca,25-esquina Sicilia, en Onda, ha celebrado&nbsp;este s&aacute;bado su tercer aniversario, con la fiesta #MIDELITO, sorteos&nbsp;y la actuaci&oacute;n de Two for blues. Algunas personas han optado por acudir disfrazadas. Adem&aacute;s de este local, Inma Campos Campos y Toni Garc&iacute;a Cuadros abrieron en abril La Oveja Negra Rock&#39;n&#39;Roll Music en la calle Ros d&#39;Orsins, 20.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3eraniversarilaovejanegra/img_3072.jpg\" alt=\"img_3072\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3eraniversarilaovejanegra/img_3074.jpg\" alt=\"img_3074\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3eraniversarilaovejanegra/img_3075.jpg\" alt=\"img_3075\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3eraniversarilaovejanegra/img_3076.jpg\" alt=\"img_3076\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3eraniversarilaovejanegra/img_3078.jpg\" alt=\"img_3078\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3eraniversarilaovejanegra/img_3080.jpg\" alt=\"img_3080\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3eraniversarilaovejanegra/img_3081.jpg\" alt=\"img_3081\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3eraniversarilaovejanegra/img_3082.jpg\" alt=\"img_3082\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"h